# ONE — 007 / Universal Scripture Private Import Bridge

This adds a local, owner-selected metadata preview within the existing ONE application. It does not ship any private original sources or claim complete copies of religious texts.

Open index.html, choose the private JSON from Nathan_AI_007_Universal_Scriptures_Recovery_2026-11-01.zip, inspect the 195 EX007 records, 49 sacred-text references, and recovered source/crosswalk metadata. To retain the index, manually import the same JSON into the already existing ONE Master Library. Keep the source ZIP with the original bytes and checksums.

No public corpus, network request, automatic upload, cloud sync, rights approval or publication. The original files are not rewritten; 007 source indices and modern research comparisons remain distinct.

Run: node --test app-factory/one/scriptures-007/engine.test.cjs


**Continuous master (original preserved verbatim; expansion appended):** [NATHAN AI — KJV, STRONG’S & UNIVERSAL ROOT LANGUAGE MATRIX](./NATHAN_AI_KJV_STRONGS_UNIVERSAL_ROOT_MATRIX_MASTER.md). This is a source-preserving expansion alongside the private 007 import bridge, not a replacement or an import of the owner's unseen ZIP archive.
